    "head_branch": "feature/rout-tend-landings-settled",
    "head_commit_message": "perf(native): the rout's and tend's serial reads off the serial path (spec 42 step 3)\n\nSpec 42 step 3, rescoped by the owner with outcomes unchanged: the rout's\njoins and tend's takings aren't contested (joins have no room, every taker\nstrikes, the order is already the key's and the draws'), so nothing is\nsettled in rounds. Instead:\n- flee returns with no router, so a quiet tick builds no view of the field;\n- the rout's view reads each squad's points and bodies on the pool;\n- the pass reads the roster again only when the rallies, re-forms or breaks\n  read it;\n- tend reads its squads' records on the pool, and groups takers by body\n  through an index.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi52od7h4VM71tzqtqJ",
